tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk#publisher-builder-options","content":"A batch also flushes once its accumulated payload reaches IggyPublisherConfig.BackgroundMaxBatchBytes (default 256 KiB, 0 disables the byte gate) - whichever of batchSize or the byte limit is hit first. This knob has no builder method. Set it on the config directly if needed. Await WaitUntilAllSendsAsync before disposal to finish queued sends; disposal alone can discard them. Background send calls return an empty confirmation list before delivery, and failures are reported through the subscribed events."},"5994":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk-95","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk#publishing-with-rented-batches","content":"SendMessagesAsync accepts messages with ReadOnlyMemory<byte> payloads, which can share backing storage. On hot paths, build a RentedMessageBatch instead - every payload is written into a single buffer rented from the shared array pool - and hand it to SendAsync:"},"5995":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk-96","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk#publishing-with-rented-batches","content":"RentedMessageBatchBuilder:"},"5996":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk-97","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk#publishing-with-rented-batches","content":"Member"},"5997":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk-98","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk#publishing-with-rented-batches","content":"Description"},"5998":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk-99","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/high-level-sdk#publishing-with-rented-batches","content":"new RentedMessageBatchBuilder(sizeHint = 1024)"},"5999":{"id":"/docs/sdk