ue 0 is reserved and never sent."],[899,"Value 0 is reserved and rejected. The 64..127 range is reserved for server-internal operations (currently 64 through 68 are assigned) and every value in it is refused from clients."],[4121,"Value forms are forgiving: byte sizes accept a raw number of bytes or a string like \"128 MiB\", expiry accepts microseconds or a humantime string like \"7 days\", booleans accept true/false. Create admission re-parses and re-encodes what you send, so a string segment_size=128MiB is stored as the number it names."],[2118,"value_pattern variants: equals (any JSON value), contains (substring), regex, greater_than, less_than, between (e.g. { between = [1.0, 10.0] }), and the parameterless checks is_null, is_not_null, is_string, is_number, is_boolean, is_object, is_array (written as plain strings, e.g. value_pattern = \"is_number\")."],[811,"Values a client may send:"],[6391,"Variant"],[388,"Verbatim from the admitted request"],[5535,"verbose and benchmark are optional and default to false. verbose switches the connector's per-batch logging to info level, and benchmark emits per-batch timing events for performance measurement."],[4253,"verbose_logging"],[4764,"verbose_logging"],[4849,"verbose_logging"],[4910,"verbose_logging"],[5443,"verbose_logging"],[5062,"verbose, benchmark"],[5533,"verbose, benchmark"],[1880,"verbose: logs additional per-batch details for the connector."],[3140,"Verification key. If both secrets are set, they are used as supplied and must agree for self-issued tokens to verify."],[3765,"Verify actual usage in /proc/PID/smaps: AnonHugePages reports PMD-sized anonymous THP, while Private_Hugetlb and Shared_Hugetlb identify explicit huge-page mappings. A successful pool reservation alone does not prove Iggy used it."],[3362,"Verify client heartbeats."],[4582,"version"],[5048,"version"],[5274,"version"],[5519,"version"],[2149,"Versioning"],[2157,"Very high throughput for both writes and reads"],[742,"view"],[939,"view"],[1055,